    :printedText """Vigilance
This creature gets +2/+0 as long as you've committed a crime this turn. (Targeting opponents, anything they control, and/or cards in their graveyards is a crime.)"""@en ;
    :oracleText """Vigilance
This creature gets +2/+0 as long as you've committed a crime this turn. (Targeting opponents, anything they control, and/or cards in their graveyards is a crime.)"""@en ;
    :flavorText """"Sure it's risky, but that's what makes it fun! That and the money. And the bankers' faces.\""""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=655009"^^xsd:anyURI ;
